# Trivy Vulnerability Ignore File
# Format: CVE-ID [expiration-date] [comment]
#
# These CVEs are acknowledged and accepted for the following reasons.
# Each entry must be reviewed before the project goes to production.

# All CRITICAL/HIGH CVEs are now patched via npm overrides in package.json:
#   tar >= 7.5.8, cross-spawn >= 7.0.5, fast-xml-parser >= 4.5.4,
#   minimatch >= 9.0.7, glob >= 10.5.0
#
# Add entries here ONLY for CVEs that cannot be patched (e.g., no fix available
# or fixing breaks a required dependency).
